      "description": "IDP Value & ROI Calculator | Lightico Blog Help Center Login Request Demo Platform Left Column AI IDP AI powered Intelligent Document Processing for I-9s, KYC, Loan Processing & More AI IDP ROI Calculator Estimate the the ROI Intelligent Document Processing could provide for you. Cases Streamline your documents, tasks, updates, and approvals into one place eSignatures Get customer eSignature and consents instantly & remotely﻿﻿﻿ ID Verification Advanced Identity & ID Verification tools to fight fraud eForms Collect your customer’s data using eForms in any channel Workflow Automation Easily design & adjust customer-facing processes using a workflow engine Right Column Other Products Digital Consent & Approvals Secure Payments Visual Cart Shared Review Media Sharing Lightico for Salesforce Security & Compliance Industries Industries Auto Finance Banking Consumer Lending Telcos Utilities Credit Unions Healthcare Insurance Legal Teams Channels BPO Contact Centers Mass Campaigns Point of Sales & Service Self Service Customers Customer Success Stories Customer Success Management Company About Us Careers Partners Request demo Lightico AI-Powered Intelligent Document Processing Calculate your AI-IDP value and ROI Estimate the labour hours, cycle time and compliance exposure Lightico's Intelligent Document Processing (AI-IDP) cuts from your workflows, based on your own document volume and adoption stage. Estimated annual value Live estimate – – labour productivity + – regulatory exposure reduced Adoption stage Early stage Fully optimized Cycle time – – FTE hours reallocated – freed per year FTE – redeployable analysts Straight-through – 8 % human review Talk to an expert Copy link Download results Indicative estimate based on modelled assumptions, not a commitment. How it's calculated Currency £ GBP € EUR $ USD Processes per year Documents per process – Average pages per document – Time per process 30 min – Trusted by regulated enterprises Customer results – – Whether you're just getting started with document automation or already running Lightico journeys end-to-end, AI-IDP fits right in. Use it as a standalone tool to tackle document-heavy processes on its own, or layer it into your existing journeys to add intelligent data extraction and validation to workflows you've already built without needing to start over. How Lightico AI-IDP helps each industry Mortgage Turn incoming mortgage documents into a complete, underwriting-ready file in a day. Lightico AI-IDP automates mortgage document processing by extracting, classifying and validating income verification, bank statements, credit documents and title paperwork as they arrive. Underwriters and quality assurance and compliance teams receive complete, indexed files with fewer missing documents and exceptions, a clear audit trail and less manual review. The result is faster underwriting, greater operational capacity and support for accelerated mortgage close programmes. Auto Finance Faster time to funding. Lightico AI-IDP classifies and extracts everything in the deal jacket, from loan applications and pay stubs to credit reports, titles and dealer stips, and routes it into the LOS ready for a funding decision. Fewer deals get stuck on stips, NIGO rates drop, and analysts clear more packages as volume climbs, without adding headcount. Retail Banking New accounts that clear KYC in one sitting. Lightico AI-IDP extracts and validates every document in the KYC bundle at account opening and passes the data into core banking systems. Paired with real-time ID verification and biometric matching, the whole journey runs from a customer's phone, with no branch visit and no review backlog. Hiring Compliance Every I-9 right, first time. Lightico captures List A, B and C documents, completes the form and submits to E-Verify in one guided session on the employee's phone, flagging invalid document combinations before they are ever filed. It holds up across high-volume, multi-location hiring, where a single missed form turns into a costly compliance gap: see how this plays out in our I-9 compliance for high-volume retail hiring case study. HR Onboarding One session. Every form. Zero chasing. Lightico AI-IDP pulls the I-9, W-4 and state tax forms, direct deposit details, benefit elections and policy acknowledgements into one guided, mobile-first session with built-in validation and eSignature. Every new hire becomes a single audit-ready record, complete on day one, however many systems and sites are involved. Insurance Claims that start the second they are filed. AI-IDP reads FNOL and claims documents, policy applications and servicing paperwork as customers submit them, extracting the detail that matters and moving each case into servicing. Agents, brokers and self-service all feed one validated pipeline, so nothing stalls on re-keying. Healthcare A complete patient file before the first visit. AI-IDP captures intake, eligibility and enrolment documents and writes the data into member and patient records, with consent and authorisation signed in the same session. Care and enrolment teams begin with a verified file and no gaps to chase. Fully HIPAA compliant. Energy & Utilities Assistance approved without the paperwork backlog. Lightico AI-IDP collects and validates eligibility documents at intake, proof of income, ID, utility bills and proof of residence, and updates programme systems automatically. Providers clear applications at enterprise volume without a manual review queue. Legal & Professional Services Client files complete on day one. Lightico AI-IDP captures client and matter intake documents, verifies them on submission and feeds the data into case and practice systems. Fee earners open a clean, complete file and bill from the start, with no document chasing. Telecommunications Sign-ups that never stall on a document. Lightico captures proof of ID and address, credit and affordability checks and contract paperwork, validating each one inside the journey",
