      "description": "Customer Journey Automation for Financial | Lightico Blog Help Center Login Request Demo Platform Left Column AI IDP AI powered Intelligent Document Processing for I-9s, KYC, Loan Processing & More AI IDP ROI Calculator Estimate the the ROI Intelligent Document Processing could provide for you. Cases Streamline your documents, tasks, updates, and approvals into one place eSignatures Get customer eSignature and consents instantly & remotely﻿﻿﻿ ID Verification Advanced Identity & ID Verification tools to fight fraud eForms Collect your customer’s data using eForms in any channel Workflow Automation Easily design & adjust customer-facing processes using a workflow engine Right Column Other Products Digital Consent & Approvals Secure Payments Visual Cart Shared Review Media Sharing Lightico for Salesforce Security & Compliance Industries Industries Auto Finance Banking Consumer Lending Telcos Utilities Credit Unions Healthcare Insurance Legal Teams Channels BPO Contact Centers Mass Campaigns Point of Sales & Service Self Service Customers Customer Success Stories Customer Success Management Company About Us Careers Partners Request demo Built for the World's Most Complex Customer Journeys The world’s largest banks and Telcos use Lightico to turn high-friction customer journeys into seamless, compliant digital experiences with minimal IT investment. Our AI-powered platform automates complex, regulated processes across the entire customer lifecycle and any channel, from sales and onboarding to service and retention. Replace slow, manual processes with frictionless journeys that reduce average handling time, improve operational efficiency and increase customer satisfaction while delivering 100% compliance. All delivered in weeks, not months, with zero system disruption. 13 % Sales Uplift 25 % Reduction in AHT 15 % Higher NPS Executive Leadership Zviki Ben Ishay CEO & Co-Founder Justin Josh CTO & Co-Founder Omri Braun COO & Co-Founder Bill Safran Chief Strategy Officer Avi Lousky EVP Product Richard Grey Chief Revenue Officer Jeff Dobo EVP North America Shani Kotzer Global EVP HR Toni Kemp VP HR EMEA Gaby Young VP Marketing Liran Assulin VP Engineering Moris Malka VP Strategic Partnerships Gabi Berger VP Global Support Shelly Myers VP Customer Success EMEA Rhydian Perry Global VP Operations & DPO Zviki Ben Ishay CEO & Co-Founder Zviki founded Lightico after 17 years of helping businesses improve the way they service and sell their customers – with an emphasis on using technology to simplify customer journeys. Zviki has done this in several roles and from many angles including fostering effective interaction management, compliance assurance, and customer delight. Justin Josh CTO & Co-Founder Justin brings a strong R&D and product background as Lightico's CTO. Prior to founding Lightico, Justin was the VP R&D at Bynet Data Communications. Before that, he spent six years leading the product team at Netcom. Omri Braun COO & Co-Founder An entrepreneur for many years, Omri has been involved in the establishment of many startup companies, both in a co-founder and advisory capacity. Bill Safran Chief Strategy Officer Bill has over 20 years of experience managing and growing software businesses serving the financial services and telco sectors. Previously, he was CEO and co-founder of Vizolution, which was acquired by Lightico in 2023. Bill earned his MBA from The Wharton School. Avi Lousky EVP Product Avi brings a strong enterprise product background to Lightico. Prior to Lightico, he had a brief stint as product manager at Verint. Before Verint, he spent nearly 14 years in several managerial roles at NICE. Avi earned his MBA from Tel Aviv University. Richard Grey Chief Revenue Officer Richard Grey is the Chief Revenue Officer at Lightico, responsible for leading global revenue strategy and execution across marketing, sales, partnerships, and customer success. He is committed to fostering a culture of collaboration and accountability, empowering teams to deliver meaningful outcomes for customers and partners. With a focus on growth through excellence, Richard ensures Lightico’s go-to-market organization operates with clarity, purpose, and shared success. Jeff Dobo EVP North America Over the past 18 years, Jeff has built and led enterprise sales teams and comes with an exceptional track record of delivering results in highly competitive environments while fostering key partnerships with leading global technology innovators. Having spent the majority of his career with large global corporations, Jeff’s expertise consists of many layers including sales, operations, finance and marketing. Shani Kotzer Global EVP HR Shani is both a doer and a people's person. She co-founded the biggest SW placement company for the tech industry, which was acquired in 2015 by Matrix. She has extensive experience managing teams and TLs and establishing companies' cultures and values. Toni Kemp VP HR EMEA With over 30 years experience in Human Resources as a generalist practitioner holding a number of executive positions Toni is a highly motivated, multi-skilled and adaptable Human Resources Professional enabling her to mitigate risk to both the business and its people. Prior to the acquisition of Vizolution she was responsible for all aspects of organisational and transformational change. Toni was invited on a number of occasions as a guest lecturer at Bath University where she delivered a session on Managing People, Strategy and Practice for students completing their MBA in Human Resources. A key driver for diversity and inclusion within the business Toni is keen to attract more woman and under represented groups in tech into the business. Prior to joining the business she was Vice Chair of the Board and Chair Personnel Committee at Cardiff YMCA Housing Association and is a current trustee of Purple Heart Wishes Gaby Young VP Marketing Gaby Young is Lightico’s VP Marketing. With a strong background in marketing communications,",
